WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.873 --> 00:00:06.933
You don't need an account to ask for help. This is the Get help page, and anyone can use it.

2
00:00:07.435 --> 00:00:14.355
Enter your name and your email address. Use an address you can check, because we use it to find your request again.

3
00:00:14.855 --> 00:00:25.435
Choose what you need help with. A short list of quick answers for that topic appears at the top of the page. It's worth a look first, because one of them might fix things right away.

4
00:00:25.938 --> 00:00:29.718
If it doesn't help, add a subject, and describe what's happening.

5
00:00:30.507 --> 00:00:32.337
Select Send request.

6
00:00:32.839 --> 00:00:46.669
You get a reference number. Write it down, or take a screenshot. You'll need it, together with your email address, to see our reply. We also send a copy of your request to your email, and it shows the reference too.

7
00:00:47.171 --> 00:00:54.011
We don't email our replies. They appear on this page. So later, come back to the Get help page.

8
00:00:54.513 --> 00:01:01.803
Find the box that says, Already sent a request? Type your reference and the email you used, and select Look it up.

9
00:01:02.304 --> 00:01:11.084
Here's the whole conversation, with our reply. If you wrote the wrong reference or email, we'll tell you we couldn't find it, and you can try again.

10
00:01:11.584 --> 00:01:16.024
To answer, or to add something, type here, and select Send.

11
00:01:16.525 --> 00:01:22.275
That's it. If you ever lose your reference, just send a new request and mention the old one.
